---
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
const title = `Technology | ${SITE_TITLE}`;
const description = 'A practical look at the browser technologies behind AlienX: Astro, CSS, JavaScript, accessibility, performance, and progressive enhancement.';
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><BaseHead title={title} description={description} /></head><body><Header />
<main>
<section class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">ALIENX / TECHNOLOGY</p><h1>The browser is <span>the machine.</span></h1><p class="lede">The Experience page lets you operate the system. This page shows what makes it possible: a small set of browser primitives working together to turn input into a responsive interface.</p></section>
<section class="architecture" aria-labelledby="architecture-title"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">01 / THE STACK</p><h2 id="architecture-title">Few layers. Deliberate behavior.</h2></div><div class="stack"><article><span>01</span><h3>Astro</h3><p>Server-first rendering keeps the document useful and lightweight, while focused islands add interaction where it earns its place.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>CSS</h3><p>Layout, motion, gradients, responsive behavior, and visual state are handled close to the platform instead of behind a heavyweight UI abstraction.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>JavaScript</h3><p>Interaction is local when it can be. Events update state and the DOM without turning every visual change into a network request.</p></article><article><span>04</span><h3>Cloudflare</h3><p>The finished site runs at the edge, giving the experience a direct path from source code to a globally distributed runtime.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="system" aria-labelledby="system-title"><div class="system-copy"><p class="eyebrow">02 / THE PIPELINE</p><h2 id="system-title">From input to experience.</h2><p>This is the same sequence you can operate on the Experience page. Here, the mechanism is the subject.</p></div><div class="pipeline" data-pipeline><div class="pipeline-step is-active"><span>01</span><strong>INPUT</strong><small>Pointer, keyboard, scroll</small></div><div class="pipeline-step"><span>02</span><strong>EVENT</strong><small>Browser receives it</small></div><div class="pipeline-step"><span>03</span><strong>STATE</strong><small>Interface decides</small></div><div class="pipeline-step"><span>04</span><strong>RENDER</strong><small>DOM + CSS respond</small></div><div class="pipeline-result"><span data-result-status>READY</span><strong data-result>EXPERIENCE</strong></div></div></section>
<section class="demo" aria-labelledby="demo-title"><div class="demo-copy"><p class="eyebrow">03 / BROWSER STATE</p><h2 id="demo-title">A tiny state machine.</h2><p>Change the state. Nothing is fetched, nothing is authenticated, and nothing leaves the browser. The same idea becomes tangible on the Experience page.</p></div><div class="state-panel" data-state-panel><div class="state-topline"><span>AMBIENT CORE</span><span data-state-label>CALM</span></div><div class="orb" data-orb aria-hidden="true"></div><output class="state-value" data-state-value>72%</output><div class="state-controls" aria-label="Ambient state controls"><button type="button" data-state="calm" aria-pressed="true">Calm</button><button type="button" data-state="focus" aria-pressed="false">Focus</button><button type="button" data-state="pulse" aria-pressed="false">Pulse</button></div></div></section>
<section class="principles" aria-labelledby="principles-title"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">04 / ENGINEERING PRINCIPLES</p><h2 id="principles-title">The invisible features matter.</h2></div><div class="principle-grid"><article><h3>Accessible by default</h3><p>Semantic HTML, visible focus states, meaningful labels, keyboard-friendly controls, and reduced-motion support are treated as product features.</p></article><article><h3>Progressive enhancement</h3><p>The document remains useful before JavaScript executes. Interactivity enhances the experience instead of becoming the only way to access it.</p></article><article><h3>Performance conscious</h3><p>Less JavaScript, fewer dependencies, optimized assets, and server-first rendering keep the critical path small.</p></article><article><h3>Inspectable</h3><p>The interface is intentionally built from understandable web primitives. View source, inspect the DOM, and see how the effect works.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="closing"><p class="eyebrow">05 / THE POINT</p><h2>The stack is not the experience.</h2><p>{SITE_TITLE} is fictional. The engineering is real. Technology matters because it gives the interface room to respond, adapt, and become something worth interacting with.</p></section>
</main><Footer />
<script>
const pipeline=document.querySelector('[data-pipeline]');const steps=document.querySelectorAll('.pipeline-step');const result=document.querySelector('[data-result]');const resultStatus=document.querySelector('[data-result-status]');let pipelineTimer=0;pipeline?.addEventListener('mouseenter',()=>{steps.forEach((step,index)=>{step.classList.toggle('is-active',index===0)});clearInterval(pipelineTimer);let index=0;pipelineTimer=window.setInterval(()=>{index=(index+1)%steps.length;steps.forEach((step,i)=>step.classList.toggle('is-active',i===index));if(result&&resultStatus){resultStatus.textContent=index===steps.length-1?'RENDERED':'PROCESSING';result.textContent=index===steps.length-1?'EXPERIENCE':steps[index].querySelector('strong')?.textContent||'STATE'}},700)});pipeline?.addEventListener('mouseleave',()=>{clearInterval(pipelineTimer);steps.forEach((step,index)=>step.classList.toggle('is-active',index===0));if(resultStatus)resultStatus.textContent='READY';if(result)result.textContent='EXPERIENCE'});
const panel=document.querySelector('[data-state-panel]');const orb=document.querySelector('[data-orb]');const label=document.querySelector('[data-state-label]');const value=document.querySelector('[data-state-value]');const buttons=document.querySelectorAll('[data-state]');const states={calm:{label:'CALM',value:'72%',className:'is-calm'},focus:{label:'FOCUS',value:'86%',className:'is-focus'},pulse:{label:'PULSE',value:'94%',className:'is-pulse'}};buttons.forEach((button)=>{button.addEventListener('click',()=>{const state=states[button.dataset.state];if(!state||!panel||!orb||!label||!value)return;panel.classList.remove('is-calm','is-focus','is-pulse');panel.classList.add(state.className);label.textContent=state.label;value.textContent=state.value;buttons.forEach((item)=>item.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(item===button)))})});
</script>
<style>
:global(html){background:var(--technology-background);color:var(--technology-text)}:global(body){margin:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 75% 10%,rgba(37,99,235,.10),transparent 34rem),var(--technology-background)}:global(body){--technology-background:#05070c;--technology-surface:#080b12;--technology-surface-hover:#0d1220;--technology-text:#edf1fb;--technology-heading:#f6f8ff;--technology-muted:#9da8bd;--technology-soft:#9aa5ba;--technology-border:#20283a;--technology-border-strong:#252e43;--technology-control:#0c111b;--technology-control-text:#a0abc0;--technology-accent:var(--brand-green)}main{overflow:hidden}.hero,.architecture,.system,.demo,.principles,.closing{width:min(1120px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:auto}.hero{padding:clamp(90px,14vw,170px) 0 110px}.eyebrow{margin:0 0 18px;color:var(--technology-soft);font-size:.68rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.18em}h1,h2,h3,p{margin-top:0}h1{max-width:900px;margin-bottom:28px;color:var(--technology-heading);font-size:clamp(3rem,8vw,7rem);line-height:.92;letter-spacing:-.065em}h1 span{color:var(--technology-accent)}.lede{max-width:700px;color:var(--technology-muted);font-size:clamp(1rem,2vw,1.25rem);line-height:1.7}.section-heading{margin-bottom:42px}h2{max-width:800px;margin-bottom:0;color:var(--technology-heading);font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,4rem);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.045em}.stack,.principle-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--technology-border);border:1px solid var(--technology-border)}.stack article,.principle-grid article{padding:34px;background:var(--technology-surface);min-height:190px}.stack span{color:var(--technology-soft);font-size:.72rem;font-weight:800}h3{margin:18px 0 12px;color:var(--technology-heading);font-size:1.15rem}.stack p,.principle-grid p,.closing p,.system-copy p,.demo-copy p{color:var(--technology-muted);line-height:1.7}
.system{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:70px;align-items:center;padding:150px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--technology-border)}.pipeline{border:1px solid var(--technology-border-strong);background:var(--technology-surface);border-radius:28px;overflow:hidden}.pipeline-step{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:46px 110px 1fr;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:18px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--technology-border);color:var(--technology-muted);transition:background 220ms ease,color 220ms ease,transform 220ms ease}.pipeline-step span{font-size:.62rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--technology-soft)}.pipeline-step strong{font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.12em}.pipeline-step small{font-size:.76rem}.pipeline-step.is-active{background:rgba(57,255,90,.06);color:var(--technology-heading);transform:translateX(8px)}.pipeline-step.is-active span{color:var(--technology-accent)}.pipeline-step.is-active::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:2px;background:var(--technology-accent)}.pipeline-result{padding:28px 22px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end}.pipeline-result span{color:var(--technology-accent);font-size:.62rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em}.pipeline-result strong{color:var(--technology-heading);font-size:1.4rem;letter-spacing:-.03em}
.demo{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:70px;align-items:center;padding:80px 0 150px}.state-panel{position:relative;min-height:390px;padding:28px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid rgba(57,255,90,.28);border-radius:28px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#0d1a11,#070910);box-shadow:0 30px 100px rgba(0,0,0,.4)}.state-topline{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:var(--technology-soft);font-size:.68rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em}.orb{width:210px;height:210px;margin:55px auto 25px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%,#f0fff2 0 2%,rgba(200,255,207,.65) 4%,rgba(57,255,90,.35) 23%,rgba(30,170,61,.14) 47%,transparent 70%);filter:blur(.2px);transition:transform 500ms ease,filter 500ms ease}.state-value{display:block;color:var(--technology-heading);text-align:center;font-size:2.5rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.05em}.state-controls{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:8px;margin-top:22px}.state-controls button{cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--technology-border-strong);border-radius:999px;padding:9px 14px;background:var(--technology-control);color:var(--technology-control-text);font:inherit;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:800}.state-controls button:hover,.state-controls button:focus-visible{color:var(--technology-heading);border-color:#4f7659;outline:none}.state-controls button[aria-pressed="true"]{color:#041006;background:var(--technology-accent);border-color:var(--technology-accent)}.is-focus .orb{transform:scale(.82);filter:saturate(.75)}.is-pulse .orb{transform:scale(1.18);filter:saturate(1.35)}.principles{padding-bottom:150px}.closing{padding:80px 0 150px;border-top:1px solid var(--technology-border)}.closing h2{margin-bottom:25px}.closing p:last-child{max-width:650px}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:light){:global(html){background:#fff}:global(body){--technology-background:#fff;--technology-surface:#f5f7fb;--technology-surface-hover:#eef2f8;--technology-text:#1d2433;--technology-heading:#0f1219;--technology-muted:#60739f;--technology-soft:#687797;--technology-border:#e1e6ef;--technology-border-strong:#c8d0df;--technology-control:#f4f6fa;--technology-control-text:#52617d;--technology-accent:var(--brand-green-dark);background:radial-gradient(circle at 75% 10%,rgba(37,99,235,.07),transparent 34rem),var(--technology-background)}.state-panel{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f7fbf8,#edf5ef);box-shadow:0 30px 100px rgba(53,94,63,.14)}.state-controls button[aria-pressed="true"]{color:#fff}.pipeline-step.is-active{background:rgba(22,163,74,.07)}}@media(max-width:760px){.hero,.architecture,.system,.demo,.principles,.closing{width:min(100% - 28px,1120px)}.stack,.principle-grid,.system,.demo{grid-template-columns:1fr}.system{padding:100px 0;gap:45px}.demo{padding:80px 0 100px;gap:45px}.stack article,.principle-grid article{padding:25px}.pipeline-step{grid-template-columns:38px 90px 1fr;padding:16px}.pipeline-step small{font-size:.68rem}.state-panel{min-height:340px}.orb{width:175px;height:175px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.orb,.pipeline-step{transition:none}.pipeline-step{transform:none!important}.pipeline-step.is-active{transform:none!important}}
</style></body></html>
